===2026 election===
The [[2026 New Zealand general election|next election]] will be held on 7 November 2026. Candidates for Takanini are listed at ''[[Candidates in the 2026 New Zealand general election by electorate#Takanini|Candidates in the 2026 New Zealand general election by electorate § Takanini]]''. Official results will be available after 27 November 2026.<ref name="ge2026_dates">{{Cite web |last= |date=2026 |title=Key dates |url=https://vote.nz/2026-general-election/about/overview/key-dates |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260415030403/https://vote.nz/2026-general-election/about/overview/key-dates |archive-date=15 April 2026 |access-date=27 April 2026 |website=Vote NZ}}</ref>

